            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"frequent_values = {\" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Harus ada koma yang memisahkan nilai-nilai set</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Set tidak bisa memiliki nilai float seperti <code>17.5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kodenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Harus ada koma yang memisahkan nilai-nilai set.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengganti mana yang membuat set yang dimaksud tanpa mengubah value apa pun?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"frequent_values = {\" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>frequent_values = {34, 20, 17, 17.5}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>frequent_values = [34, 20, 17, 17.5]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>frequent_values = {34 20 17}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>frequent_values = {34, 20, 17, 17.5}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 89505,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Himpunan <code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">List <code>[2929, 1101, 1134]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nama variabel <code>entrance_codes</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Himpunan <code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika <code>1101</code> lain disertakan saat <code>entrance_codes</code> dibuat, berapa banyak value berbeda yang disimpan set?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tiga, karena set hanya menyimpan <code>1101</code> satu kali</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Empat, karena set mempertahankan nilai duplikat</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dua, karena menambahkan duplikat menghapus kedua salinan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tiga, karena set hanya menyimpan <code>1101</code> satu kali.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
